<%- include('partials/head') %><%- include('partials/header') %><main class="page-shell finance-shell"><a class="back-link" href="/dashboard">← ホームへ戻る</a><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow"><%= association.name %></p><h1>会計報告</h1><p>町内会が公開している会計情報を確認できます。</p></div></div><section class="content-card finance-public-summary"><div class="finance-card-heading"><div><h2>年度集計</h2><p class="finance-period">期間：<%= year %>年<%= startMonth %>月　〜　<%= endYear %>年<%= endMonth %>月</p></div><form method="get"><select name="year" onchange="this.form.submit()"><% for (let fiscal = new Date().getFullYear() - 2; fiscal <= new Date().getFullYear() + 3; fiscal++) { %><option value="<%= fiscal %>" <%= fiscal === year ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= fiscal %>年度</option><% } %></select></form></div><div class="finance-total-row finance-total-income"><span>収入</span><strong>¥<%= Number(actual['収入'] || 0).toLocaleString() %> / ¥<%= Number(budget['収入'] || 0).toLocaleString() %></strong></div><div class="finance-total-row finance-total-expense"><span>支出</span><strong>¥<%= Number(actual['支出'] || 0).toLocaleString() %> / ¥<%= Number(budget['支出'] || 0).toLocaleString() %></strong></div></section><section class="content-card finance-public-menu"><a class="settings-entry-card" href="/associations/<%= association._id %>/finance/annual?public=1"><strong>▱ 年度集計</strong><span>月別・項目別の予算と実績を確認</span></a><a class="settings-entry-card" href="/associations/<%= association._id %>/finance/expense-chart?public=1"><strong>⌁ 支出項目別グラフ</strong><span>年度別の支出項目を比較</span></a><a class="settings-entry-card" href="/associations/<%= association._id %>/finance/monthly-expense-chart?public=1"><strong>▥ 月別支出項目別グラフ</strong><span>複数年度の月別支出を比較</span></a></section></main><%- include('partials/foot') %>
